                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Delivery Distance:  </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Aka p-d distance, it is the Manhattan distance (meters) between vendor location coordinates and customer location coordinates. This distance doesn&apos;t take into account potential stacked deliveries and it&apos;s not the travelled distance.</run>
